P-NOPLAN" class="flex items-baseline gap-2 text-[14.5px] leading-snug"><span data-num="5" data-den="49" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash" class="shrink-0 font-bold text-[#1d2025]">5 of 49</span><span class="text-[#374151]">Practice never set</span></li></ul><p data-num="17" data-den="49" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash" class="text-[12.5px] text-[#6b7280]">of the same 49 lessons</p></section><section data-testid="w-where" class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-2xl border border-[#e5e7eb] bg-white px-4 py-3.5 shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(16,24,40,0.05)] "><h2 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-[#1d2025]">Where it shows</h2><ul class="flex flex-col gap-1.5"><li data-testid="w-where-row" class="text-[14px] leading-snug text-[#374151] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><span data-code="" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">Govt. Primary School Fictional-03</span> · <span data-num="6" data-den="9" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash">6 of 9</span> lessons · visit <span data-date="2026-10-28">Wed 28 Oct</span></li><li data-testid="w-where-row" class="text-[14px] leading-snug text-[#374151] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><span data-code="" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">Govt. Primary School Fictional-05</span> · <span data-num="5" data-den="11" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash">5 of 11</span> lessons · visit <span data-date="2026-11-03">Tue 3 Nov</span></li><li data-testid="w-where-row" class="text-[14px] leading-snug text-[#374151] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><span data-code="" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">Govt. Primary School Fictional-02</span> · <span data-num="2" data-den="8" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash">2 of 8</span> lessons · visit <span data-date="2026-11-05">Thu 5 Nov</span></li></ul><a data-testid="w-where-all" class="flex min-h-[44px] items-center text-[14.5px] font-semibold text-[#2f6f4f]" href="/portal/coach/insights/w/W-IP-TIME/where">All schools ›</a></section><section data-testid="w-good" class="flex flex-col gap-2 rounded-2xl border border-[#e5e7eb] bg-white px-4 py-3.5 shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(16,24,40,0.05)] "><h2 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-[#1d2025]">What good looks like</h2><p data-text="library" class="text-[14px] leading-snug text-[#374151]">The teacher reads the plan's task aloud in one sentence, says how many items and where, and says the time. A child is timekeeper. The room drops to a murmur. The teacher moves along the aisle and says one specific line to five children, one per row, in under 30 seconds each. A signal ends it with at least three minutes left for the closure check.</p></section><details data-testid="w-method" class="group rounded-2xl border border-[#e5e7eb] bg-white px-4 py-3"><summary class="flex min-h-[44px] cursor-pointer items-center text-[15px] font-semibold text-[#1d2025]">How this was counted</summary><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 pb-1 pt-1"><p class="text-[13.5px] leading-snug text-[#374151]">Scored by lesson-plan fidelity (<span data-code="" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">google/gemini-3.8-flash</span>)</p><p data-window="w4-2026-09-28" class="text-[13.5px] leading-snug text-[#374151]">Window 28 Sep to 25 Oct, 4 weeks; rolls every Monday</p><p class="text-[13.5px] leading-snug text-[#374151]">Counted: lessons whose plan asked for this step. Not counted: recordings without a linked plan.</p><p data-num="17" data-den="49" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash" class="text-[13.5px] leading-snug text-[#374151]">Excluded: 2 lesson-mismatch, 1 unusable, 1 duplicates, 0 analysis failed</p><p data-num="53" data-den="62" data-win="w4-2026-09-28" data-grader="google/gemini-3.8-flash" class="text-[13.5px] leading-snug text-[#374151]">Of 62 recordings, 53 had a linked plan</p><p class="text-[13.5px] leading-snug text-[#374151]">Every recording counts at the teacher's current school.</p><p class="text-[13.5px] leading-snug text-[#374151]">A recording that stops early can look like a lesson that ran out of time.</p><p class="text-[12.5px] text-[#6b7280]">Query <span data-code="" class="[unicode-bidi:isolate]">q-coachip-w-ip-time-v1</span></p></div></details></div><p data-testid="trust-line" class="px-1 pt-2 text-center text-[12.5px] text-[#6b7280]">Codes, never names. For coaching, never for evaluation.</p></div></div></div>"`;

